	A <<person>> wearing an expensive <<if $pronoun is "f">>gown<<else>>suit<</if>> grasps your arm and tugs you closer. Security look away. "They won't bother us," <<he>> says. "They know who I am."
	<br><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "dancedarryl">>
	<<set $dance.event to "darryl">>
